Iridium 1.0.40 - Client Bot UX Improvements

✨ Improved UX:
- Simplified navigation: main menu now shows profile info if subscription exists
- Subscription link displayed directly in main menu (no extra buttons)
- Removed QR code and copy link buttons
- Dynamic menu: "Buy subscription" for new users, "Extend subscription" for existing
- Profile section merged into main menu for subscribers
- Cleaner interface with fewer navigation steps
